+      "intro": "When an organisation's administrator clicks \"Verify with GEMI\", we query the Greek General Commercial Registry (GEMI) for the GEMI number stated in the organisation's profile and keep a copy of the answer. Data about legal persons is not personal data; for a sole proprietorship, however, it relates to a natural person, which is why the following applies.",
