+      "publication": "What becomes public: only what the organisation chooses when it publishes its page — legal name, legal form, GEMI number and registered office to the extent it selects (full address, shop address or municipality only) — together with the verification notice and the date of the check, or the notice that the registry states the business is inactive.",
